      code='s',
      arg=None,
      stack_before=[pydict, anyobject, anyobject],
      stack_after=[pydict],
      proto=0,
      doc="""Add a key+value pair to an existing dict.

      Stack before:  ... pydict key value
      Stack after:   ... pydict

      where pydict has been modified via pydict[key] = value.
